Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 21:46:31 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1067/3799] soh: rename D_80AB0BD0 -> sCylinderInit

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: ColliderCylinderInit passed to Collider_SetCylinder in EnMu_Init.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Mu/z_en_mu.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Mu/z_en_mu.c | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Mu/z_en_mu.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Mu/z_en_mu.c
index d407ba574..acf76038f 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Mu/z_en_mu.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Mu/z_en_mu.c
@@ -17,7 +17,8 @@ void EnMu_Draw(Actor* thisx, PlayState* play);
 void EnMu_Pose(EnMu* this, PlayState* play);
 s16 EnMu_UpdateTalkState(PlayState* play, Actor* thisx);
 
-static ColliderCylinderInit D_80AB0BD0 = {
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was D_80AB0BD0: ColliderCylinderInit passed to Collider_SetCylinder in EnMu_Init.
+static ColliderCylinderInit sCylinderInit = {  // was D_80AB0BD0 [LLM:HIGH]
     {
         COLTYPE_NONE,
         AT_NONE,
@@ -134,7 +135,7 @@ void EnMu_Init(Actor* thisx, PlayState* play) {
     ActorShape_Init(&this->actor.shape, 0.0f, ActorShadow_DrawCircle, 160.0f);
     SkelAnime_InitFlex(play, &this->skelAnime, &object_mu_Skel_004F70, &object_mu_Anim_0003F4, NULL, NULL, 0);
     Collider_InitCylinder(play, &this->collider);
-    Collider_SetCylinder(play, &this->collider, &this->actor, &D_80AB0BD0);
+    Collider_SetCylinder(play, &this->collider, &this->actor, &sCylinderInit);  // was D_80AB0BD0 [LLM:HIGH]
     CollisionCheck_SetInfo2(&this->actor.colChkInfo, NULL, &D_80AB0BFC);
     this->actor.targetMode = 6;
     Actor_SetScale(&this->actor, 0.01f);
